{
  "title": "What survives a fresh start? — Specimen atlas 76",
  "headings": [
    {
      "tag": "H1",
      "id": "",
      "text": "What survives\na fresh start?",
      "y": 149
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "id": "atlas-title",
      "text": "Plate 1. The selective reset",
      "y": 485
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "A turn ends.\nThe handle stays.",
      "y": 739
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "An attempt ends.\nThe outer limit stays.",
      "y": 1144
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "id": "register-title",
      "text": "Ten findings. Nothing hidden in the stain.",
      "y": 1728
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Move the lifetime owner; keep six habitats.",
      "y": 1801
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "A cached entry is not every returned object.",
      "y": 1801
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "A failed refresh does not start a turn.",
      "y": 1985
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Clearing and finishing are different boundaries.",
      "y": 1985
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "The cut does not cancel an escaped promise.",
      "y": 2170
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Policy owns the allowance; CLI owns its use.",
      "y": 2170
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Reset the inner allowance, retain the outer budget.",
      "y": 2354
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "A number grants permission, not a retry loop.",
      "y": 2354
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "The later failure can become the visible specimen.",
      "y": 2539
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Preservation has a bounded evidence trail.",
      "y": 2539
    },
    {
      "tag": "H2",
      "id": "",
      "text": "Change one boundary. Examine the residue.",
      "y": 2815
    },
    {
      "tag": "H3",
